      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I have exactly the same problem (Vive, SteamVR 1.11.12) , and it's 100% repro. I've tried the automatic, manual, and full uninstall/reinstall of the game. As of Friday the Index controllers will just not work in your game.\nIf I turn off both controllers, the HMD becomes an active pointer (but there's no way to click). The logs don't provide much, but I'm happy to share them.\nThis happened on the same day I installed LIV overlay. I've disabled LIV (and its virtual tracker that's installed for camera placement), and there is no change. Every other game works fine, with or without LIV.\nI'm in game development (and working from home), happy to help an engineer diagnose the issue. It's a wonderful title that provides a real need in these times.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
