      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ec234d7f9a0ef61a5317947|full_name}: THIS IS THE ANSWER!!!\nthe whole controller not working in vrchat was bugging me for maybe a week but it was only with vrchat,every other game was great. my problem didn't show up until i downloaded liv and i uninstalled it earlier today thinking that would help,it didn't. i tried uninstalling everything i could(including controller drivers for gamepads and all that because in my vrchat home i noticed the holoport blue arrow thing just staying there for some reason),reinstalling and following all the rabbit holes on the internet but finally stumbled along this post.i saw the exact file you mentioned in the vrchat folder,promptly deleted it and vrchat worked again!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
