      "parentID": "5e85256f1b795372945fada1",
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5e850e0a3aedaf72bf1c66c3",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ecb42837fe2762a35cedd43|full_name}: Glad it helped!!! :D\nI made a directory with the name externalcamera.cfg (well, actually a junction, but a directory probably would work).\nThis allows me to keep LIV installed (LIV sees the \"file\" exists and doesn't recreate it, AND Unity doesn't treat the directory as a camera override). LIV is aware, and is working on a patch it until VRChat can address the issue.\nHappy gaming!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
