      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "if anyone is still active on this forum PLEASE HELP :')!\n\nIve followed EVERY STEP which inclues:\n\n-uninstalling/reinstalling steam\n\n-going in \\Steam\\steamapps\\common\\VRChat and deleting VRChat Folder\n\n-Changing characters in the desktop mode (for the hopes of it helping)\n\n-Reset bindings\n\n-reset oculus \n\nIf it helps i went into the controller debugging UI and it says everything is false.\n\nexample:\n\nSource -\n\nBinding - (priority 0)\n\nActive - False\n\nOrigin -\n\nValue - False\n\n(its like that on every /action/legacy)\n\nBut i have the same issues as the videos posted below (controllers work everywhere BUT VRChat (and OVR Toolkit)), been troubleshooting for hours and still nothing works. HALP!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
